29f0f8ba8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/ad012920e9057ff216eb7296c9296159455fd384","verification":{"payload":"tree ba789651f22b202827241ceed4a22829f0f8ba8c\nparent 69877f1c02dfd265547eab19840b7a5867f552df\nauthor Marcelo Davanço <73924875+marcelo-davanco@users.noreply.github.com> 1773719335 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773719335 -0300\n\n🔧 chore(git): require 1 review approval on all branches (dev/stg/main) (#255)\n\nEnforce code review with approval on all three protected branches,\nnot just stg and main.\n\nChanges:\n- Update .windsurfrules: all PRs require 1 review approval\n- dev ruleset updated to required_approving_review_count=1\n- main PR also requires CodeQL passing\n\nImpact: No code reaches any protected branch without a peer review.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuM8nCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACaoQAEoPerl+hXli0g2YvSBGL9hE\nENq77fsNkHHibZpuWQAOavJFh+uPXJXwYD8dafKLX4EUrf6RDngetb02dPOZcvv/\nWSxPeLz6ijoirYaBQuISP7YyyOG+BfJ70lPwYTZZW2bGYPE5s6ZEW0u7WJraeCki\ndyeg+E5+RoqzYEgq1mVT2eAffKjbZVz9Ot0wpdQxxS37Dg8S0Ilcec0VotjuTOBJ\nWG59//PXJvt6ofEfRlcanSxEnnHQLeVMcP6BH7KSFWpQ/iNS7WKJ86m0nQidtilI\ncYlkxFcGWOQeqWkPEkraxNRswq+hlxa6IUWs7pbLAikFff7NQrbGaqTBF2+Xvk6M\nkpQYN56BB1wkKPcnvObJASFih6Yw67vUocOWskWQPkoPsZmNb9JRZOFcE8esXOUU\nNIpUbR9wGAA/jUllZwaragfQ84aw4TWDWoZtCiKF5ewkx+qLVatF2Rt/heH8v/6e\niy2k44/FXIuONWgSyUrRx6rBV2UhZSGmEFB41LBT0y3Hlo9kYsw/6tI7GZmClcnM\nwiGkGhOKwz8aZEYDrIaJFMgkCArknQ+5C4unHb1WnSIDWThJ8Z5e65Y/LeNGcnZ+\nncTHYHvVbzTt1JnKq76FMAbWxlx43tTu71MlaohcdXdK/yhRigTii6Qdbmmlohi3\nbYjD0G1SmtbqaqVzM2nM\n=DNxD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-17T03:48:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followi