github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/69877f1c02dfd265547eab19840b7a5867f552df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:33:36Z","email":"73924875+marcelo-davanco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T03:33:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"🔧 chore(git): rename staging branch from sta to stg and enforce PR on all branches (#254)\n\nRename the staging branch from sta to stg to match project conventions.\nAlso enforce pull request requirement on dev branch (no direct commits to any protected branch).\n\nChanges:\n- Replace all sta references with stg in codeql-analysis.yml and .windsurfrules\n- Add pull_request rule to development ruleset (0 reviews required)\n- Update branch strategy docs: all three branches now require PR\n\nImpact: Consistent naming and enforced PR-first workflow across dev/stg/main.","tree":{"sha":"84bf83cbb347ea577fff85f05a66d33895f9e3d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/84bf83cbb347ea577fff85f05a66d33895f9e3d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/69877f1c02dfd265547eab19840b7a5867f552df","verification":{"payload":"tree 84bf83cbb347ea577fff85f05a66d33895f9e3d7\nparent 63ab143f6244024897d9fc341a066caf899dbab9\nauthor Marcelo Davanço <73924875+marcelo-davanco@users.noreply.github.com> 1773718416 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773718416 -0300\n\n🔧 chore(git): rename staging branch from sta to stg and enforce PR on all branches (#254)\n\nRename the staging branch from sta to stg to match project conventions.\nAls