anco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/23e921b892f1a9e51cba7baaee48ea39da31ce7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T01:03:29Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T01:03:29Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"message":"🔒 fix(api,cli,mock-ui): address CodeQL code scanning alerts\n\nFix all remaining CodeQL alerts across security, warning and note categories.\n\nChanges:\n- fix js/polynomial-redos: bound quantifiers in protocols.service.ts and postman.parser.ts\n- fix js/file-system-race: atomic writeFileSync (flag ''wx'') in auth.service, projects.service, cli/init\n- fix js/command-injection: whitelist + execFileSync in cli/up.ts\n- fix js/user-bypass: strict equality check in settings/transfer/import.service.ts\n- fix js/incomplete-url-substring-sanitization: URL hostname check in CoveragePage.tsx\n- fix js/useless-assignment: remove dead assignments in status, db-engines, db-snapshots services\n- fix js/unused-var: remove unused imports and variables across controllers, services and spec files\n\nImpact: eliminates all remaining CodeQL scanning alerts, improving security and code quality score","tree":{"sha":"a1e43a92109e65c79089d97f3ed68ca4