torage.service.ts (bucket/key),\n  events.service.ts (topic/exchange/vhost)\n- Validate URL scheme (HTTP/HTTPS only) before fetch() in\n  webhooks.service.ts, universal-import.service.ts, coverage.controller.ts\n- Remove unused _headers parameter from publishRabbitMQ\n\nImpact: Eliminates CodeQL js/missing-rate-limiting and js/ssrf alerts\nacross the entire API surface","tree":{"sha":"91bdceb45f0f1ec28e83d549a8cb76bdc1f19e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/91bdceb45f0f1ec28e83d549a8cb76bdc1f19e17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/4e28014319b0243014a8540746f81a66977fba62","verification":{"payload":"tree 91bdceb45f0f1ec28e83d549a8cb76bdc1f19e17\nparent a23c3a49a4da3be69c87b78f8ef1b92493ab7740\nauthor Marcelo Davanço <73924875+marcelo-davanco@users.noreply.github.com> 1773618552 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773618552 -0300\n\n🔒 security(api): add global rate limiting and fix SSRF vulnerabilities (#251)\n\nAdd ThrottlerModule globally and sanitize user-controlled inputs in\nHTTP requests to address ~100 open CodeQL code scanning alerts.\n\nChanges:\n- Add @nestjs/throttler + APP_GUARD global guard (fixes missing rate-limiting\n  alerts across all 38 controllers)\n- Encode user-provided path segments with encodeURIComponent() in\n  cloud.service.ts (bucket), storage.service.ts (bucket/key),\n  events.service.ts (topic/exchange/vhost)\n- Validate URL scheme (HTTP/HTTPS only) before fetch() in\n  webhooks.service.ts, universal-import.service.ts, coverage.controller.ts\n- Remove unused _headers parameter from publishRabbitMQ\n\nImpact: Eliminates CodeQL js/missing-rate-limiting and js/ssrf alerts\nacross the entire API surface","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpt0V4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPpoQAGe9HFlIoiEK4SBnoGDbTSAI\n07b7DW9KuIEGkZUAIf+94kT2urPjWFPpDi+mAtOydsx+7fcByjcauVd5Kh+3ZpD3\ngLqUsJQ1T+1AF4H/JLUY61JekgkXKcCGY2ugtnACT01tIOg7adyjNv0xg2VDp