 add F34 platform section with API examples, update\n  roadmap from v2.3.0 through v2.6.0, bump module count to 28\n- packages/api/README.md: add settings/ module tree (database, registry,\n  lifecycle, config, backup, import-export), add Settings & Services\n  API reference table (13 endpoints), add better-sqlite3 to tech stack\n- packages/ui/README.md: expand routes table from 8 to 30 routes,\n  include all module bridges (scenarios, stateful, webhooks, chaos,\n  coverage, governance, intelligence, templates, metrics, tracing,\n  performance, protocols, events, auth, iam, contracts, cloud, storage,\n  settings, settings/services/:id, settings/backups)\n- packages/vscode-extension/README.md: remove hardcoded vsix version\n  2.3.0, replace with Makefile targets that read version dynamically\n\nImpact: documentation accurately reflects the current v2.6.0 feature set","tree":{"sha":"ad22c86be2a0dff563efbcd72702e79615f4ccb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/ad22c86be2a0dff563efbcd72702e79615f4ccb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/a0c22ffa8494ca49224cf7fb5face7fa0c33c338","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ma