lo-davanco/stubrix/commits/7bed6e555a927040925b02b764e6249c8c959313/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T22:10:23Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T22:10:23Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"message":"🎨 style(env): remove inline comments from .env.example\n\nInline comments on the same line as values (e.g. KEY=value # comment)\ncause parsing issues in Docker Compose and some dotenv loaders which\ntreat the comment as part of the value.\n\nChanges:\n- .env.example: move all inline comments to dedicated comment lines above\n  the respective variables\n\nImpact: prevents Docker Compose from receiving malformed env values when .env.example is used as a template","tree":{"sha":"7bd7b62b26403b93d9a3936e22a33c66042d97c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/7bd7b62b26403b93d9a3936e22a33c66042d97c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/7bed6e555a927040925b02b764e6249c8c959313","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://ap