8f13ebe4066a8aaa38526cc508528160a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-15T22:09:53Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-15T22:09:53Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"message":"✨ feat(protocols): add proto file editor and gRPC live stub management\n\nExtends the Protocols module with proto file CRUD (save/list/delete files\nin mocks/proto/) and live gRPC stub management via GripMock HTTP API.\nProtocolsPage gains two new tabs: Proto Files and gRPC Stubs.\n\nChanges:\n- protocols.controller.ts: add PUT /proto/:name, GET /proto, DELETE /proto/:name,\n  POST /grpc/stubs, GET /grpc/stubs, DELETE /grpc/stubs endpoints\n- protocols.service.ts: implement proto file persistence to mocks/proto/ directory,\n  GripMock stub add/list/clear via HTTP, load template helper\n- mock-api.ts: add saveProtoFile, listProtoFiles, deleteProtoFile, addGrpcStub,\n  listGrpcStubs, clearGrpcStubs client methods\n- ProtocolsPage.tsx: add tabbed layout (Mocks / Proto Files / gRPC Stubs),\n  proto file editor with save/delete, stub form with template loader,\n  live stubs list with clear-all, GripMock offline guard\n- locales (en/es/pt): add protocols.tab*, protocols.proto*, protocols.stub*,\n  common.saving, common.edit keys; rename backups.created → backups.createdAt\n- BackupCard.tsx: update i18n key to backups.createdAt\n- mocks/proto/: add proto files directory\n\nImpact: developers can manage .proto files and inject live gRPC stubs into GripMock directly from the dashboard","tree":{"sha":"8d458115482ef22132d6c37a6ff2c7d1a48bb109","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/8d458115482ef22132d6c37a6ff2c7d1a48bb109"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/d380e198f13ebe4066a8aaa38526cc508528160a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}