url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nedpereira/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nedpereira/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nedpereira/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nedpereira/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nedpereira","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/688ff181ce4f88e954012a0d39d95d786ee3e84b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T22:38:21Z","email":"86324962+Nedpereira@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Neder\"Ned\"Pereira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T22:38:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"UI: remove Back button from sidebar pages and improve Recording badges (#247)\n\n* ✨ feat(ui): add favicon and update page title\n\n- Introduced a new favicon (icon.ico) for the application.\n- Updated the HTML to link the new favicon and changed the page title from \"ui\" to \"Stubrix\".\n\nImpact: Enhances branding and user experience with a custom icon and improved title.\n\n* ✨ feat(ui): add \"View Mocks\" link to DashboardPage\n\n- Introduced a new link in the Quick Actions section of the DashboardPage that navigates to the mocks for the current project.\n- The link includes an icon for better visual representation.\n\nImpact: Enhances user navigation by providing direct access to project mocks.\n\n* ✨ feat(db-ui): integrate internationalization support\n\n- Added a new i18n context and provider to manage translations across the database UI components.\n- Updated various components to utilize the new translation hooks, enhancing user experience with localized text.\n- Introduced a new `DbUiI18nProvider` to wrap the `DatabasesPage`, ensuring all child components have access to translation functions.\n\nImpact: Improves accessibility and usability for users by providing a localized interface.\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): enhance internationalization support across components\n\n- Integrated translation functions into various UI components, allowing for localized text.\n- Updated labels, placeholders, and messages in forms and alerts to utilize the new translation hooks.\n- Improved user experience by providing a consistent and accessible interface in multiple languages.\n\nImpact: Enhances usability and accessibility for users by offering a localized interface throughout the application.\n\n* Revert apiKey in mocks/auth/users.json to placeholder\n\nMade-with: Cursor\n\n* chore: update package-lock.json to version 1.0.0 and streamline dependencies\n\n- Downgraded package version from 2.5.0 to 1.0.0.\n- Removed unused workspace entries and devDependencies.\n- Updated various dependencies to their latest versions, ensuring compatibility with Node.js and npm.\n- Improved overall package structure and integrity checks.\n\nImpact: Reduces package size and improves dependency management.\n\n* Remove unrelated files from PR (mocks/mappings items, assets/icon.ico)\n\nMade-with: Cursor\n\n* ✨ feat(MetricsPage): refactor tab label handling for improved localization\n\n- Introduced a centralized TAB_LABELS object to manage tab labels for the MetricsPage.\n- Simplified the button rendering logic to utilize the new TAB_LABELS structure, enhancing maintainability and readability.\n\nImpact: Streamlines localization efforts and improves code clarity for future updates.\n\n* ✨ feat(i18n): enhance translation function to support variable interpolation\n\n- Updated the translation function to accept an optional `vars` parameter, allowing for dynamic variable replacement in translation strings.\n- Refactored usage in `BackupsPage` and `ServiceConfigPage` to utilize the new variable interpolation feature, improving localization flexibility.\n\nImpact: Enhances the internationalization capabilities by enabling more dynamic and context-aware translations throughout the application.\n\n* ✨ feat(i18n): refactor translation function to use useCallback for performance optimization\n\n- Updated the translation function in multiple components to utilize useCallback, enhancing performance by memoizing the function.\n- This change improves rendering efficiency and reduces unnecessary re-renders in components that rely on translation.\n\nImpact: Optimizes component performance while maintaining localization capabilities across the application.\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): optimize state management by adding useCallback to MockServersPage\n\n- Introduced useCallback in MockServersPage to enhance performance by memoizing state updates.\n- This change aims to reduce unnecessary re-renders, improving the overall efficiency of the component.\n\nImpact: Enhances rendering performance and responsiveness of the MockServersPage component.\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): enhance performance by adding useCallback to multiple pages\n\n- Introduced useCallback in CoveragePage, IntelligencePage, MockEditorPage, MocksListPage, and ProjectDashboardPage to optimize state management.\n- This change aims to reduce unnecessary re-renders, improving the overall efficiency and responsiveness of these components.\n\nImpact: Enhances rendering performance across multiple pages in the mock-ui application.\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): remove onNavigateBack prop from multiple pages for cleaner API\n\n- Eliminated the `onNavigateBack` prop from various page components including AuthPage, ChaosNetworkPage, CloudPage, and others to simplify the component API.\n- Updated corresponding bridge components to reflect this change, enhancing code clarity and maintainability.\n\nImpact: Streamlines the component structure and reduces complexity in navigation handling across the application.\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): enhance recording status indicators with new icons\n\n- Updated the ProjectDashboardPage and RecordingPanelPage to include CircleDot and StopCircle icons for active and inactive recording statuses, respectively.\n- Improved the styling of status indicators for better visual clarity and user experience.\n\nImpact: Enhances the user interface by providing clearer visual cues for recording status across the application.","tree":{"sha":"ace32e50ed3fcca69a3f340729ac253f19e9dc24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/ace32e50ed3fcca69a3f340729ac253f19e9dc24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/688ff181ce4f88e954012a0d39d95d786ee3e84b","verification":{"payload":"tree ace32e50ed3fcca69a3f340729ac253f19e9dc24\nparent a241a4d5e7447c8da3818800aba613e8aaa56ed6\nauthor Neder\"Ned\"Pereira <86324962+Nedpereira@users.noreply.github.com> 1773527901 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773527901 -0300\n\nUI: remove Back button from sidebar pages and improve Recording badges (#247)\n\n* ✨ feat(ui): add favicon and update page title\n\n- Introduced a new favicon (icon.ico) for the application.\n- Updated the HTML to link the new favicon and changed the page title from \"ui\" to \"Stubrix\".\n\nImpact: Enhances branding and user experience with a custom icon and improved title.\n\n* ✨ feat(ui): add \"View Mocks\" link to DashboardPage\n\n- Introduced a new link in the Quick Actions section of the DashboardPage that navigates to the mocks for the current project.\n- The link includes an icon for better visual representation.\n\nImpact: Enhances user navigation by providing direct access to project mocks.\n\n* ✨ feat(db-ui): integrate internationalization support\n\n- Added a new i18n context and provider to manage translations across the database UI components.\n- Updated various components to utilize the new translation hooks, enhancing user experience with localized text.\n- Introduced a new `DbUiI18nProvider` to wrap the `DatabasesPage`, ensuring all child components have access to translation functions.\n\nImpact: Improves accessibility and usability for users by providing a localized interface.\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): enhance