anco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/d2b93afeff4f5fb1517868b564121b9a29509578/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T22:31:02Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T22:31:02Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"message":"🐛 fix(settings): make restartService health check fire-and-forget\n\nrestartService was blocking on waitForHealthy (60s timeout) before\nresponding, causing the API to hang until health check resolved or timed out.\n\nChanges:\n- Convert awaited waitForHealthy call to fire-and-forget promise chain\n- Return immediately with healthStatus: ''unknown'' after docker restart\n- Health status is updated asynchronously in background\n\nImpact: restart endpoint responds instantly, same pattern as enableService","tree":{"sha":"33621d5428d22433f823a8905cef61f9571eeb49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/33621d5428d22433f823a8905cef61f9571eeb49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/d2b93afeff4f5fb1517868b564121b9a29509578","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/