"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/ae8c68e31ae185e801a0672bf86e03d45e62f403/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T22:18:51Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T22:18:51Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"message":"✨ feat(settings): add autoStart per-service flag with boot logic and UI toggle\n\nA service being ''enabled'' and ''auto-started'' are now independent concepts.\nUsers can enable a service (persist its config, show it in the UI) without\nhaving it auto-launched every time Stubrix boots.\n\nChanges:\n- Add auto_start column via SQLite migration v2 (default 0)\n- Add autoStart field to ServiceRow, ServiceDefinition shared types\n- Add updateAutoStart() and getAutoStartServices() to ConfigDatabaseService\n- Boot: ServiceLifecycleService.onModuleInit() starts only enabled+auto_start=1 services\n- Add PATCH /api/settings/services/:id endpoint to toggle autoStart\n- Add updateServiceSettings() to ServiceLifecycleService\n- Fix unsafe assignment lint in service-registry.service.ts (Number() coercion)\n- UI: autoStart pill toggle shown on ServiceCard only when service is enabled\n- Wire toggleAutoStart through useSettings -> SettingsPage -> ServiceGrid -> ServiceCard\n\nImpact: users have independent control over service enablement vs. auto-boot,\npreventing unwanted containers from starting on every Stubrix restart","tree":{"sha":"7cac4fb8577293425ff34a92c6d942c4b4ed593e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/7cac4fb8577293425ff34a92c6d942c4b4ed593e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/ae8c68e31ae185e801a0672bf86e03d45e62f403","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/ae8c68e31ae185e801a0672bf86e03d45e62f403","node_id":"C_kwDOReiSwNoAKGFlOGM2OGUzMWFlMTg1ZTgwMWEwNjcyYmY4NmUwM2Q0NWU2MmY0MDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/df21dcc2a3ad1876e7605fc479a92254047b2b61","sha":"df21dcc2a3ad1876e7605fc479a92254047b2b61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/df21dcc2a3ad1876e7605fc479a92254047b2b61"}],"sha":"ae8c68e31ae185e801a0672bf86e03d45e62f403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/ae8c68e31ae185e801a0672bf86e03d45e62f403"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/df21dcc2a3ad1876e7605fc479a92254047b2b61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T22:03:36Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T22:03:36Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"message":"🐛 fix(settings): fix duplicate containers, blank screen and command await\n\nThree bugs in the F34 Settings panel:\n\n1. Duplicate containers: enabling a service multiple times called\n   `docker compose up -d` unconditionally, spinning up duplicate\n   containers for the same profile.\n\n2. Blank screen on /settings/services/:id: useServiceConfig called\n   non-existent endpoints (/schema, /config/effective, /config/rollback/:id),\n   causing unhandled 404s that crashed the page before the loading guard.\n\n3. Command await: enableService blocked the HTTP response for up to 60s\n   waiting for the health check, causing frontend timeouts.\n\nChanges:\n- Add inProgress lock to enableService to prevent concurrent calls\n- Add idempotency check to startProfile: skip up -d if profile already running\n- Add --no-recreate flag to docker compose up to prevent recreation\n- Fix useServiceConfig: /schema -> /config, /config/effective -> /config?effective=true,\n  /config/rollback/:id -> /history/:id/rollback\n- Make health check fire-and-forget in enableService so API responds immediately\n\nImpact: services can only be started once, config page loads correctly,\nand enable action responds within milliseconds instead of timing out","tree":{"sha":"f86b645fcb0583a32576b5f2cd07b0eb8c57eea8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/f86b645fcb0583a32576b5f2cd07b0eb8c57eea8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/df21dcc2a3ad1876e7605fc479a92254047b2b61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/df21dcc2a3ad1876e7605fc479a92254047b2b61","node_id":"C_kwDOReiSwNoAKGRmMjFkY2MyYTNhZDE4NzZlNzYwNWZjNDc5YTkyMjU0MDQ3YjJiNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/0754b11d73284474c8958740c4ecfc5eb827e21f","sha":"0754b11d73284474c8958740c4ecfc5eb827e21f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/0754b11d73284474c8958740c4ecfc5eb827e21f"}],"sha":"df21dcc2a3ad1876e7605fc479a92254047b2b61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/df21dcc2a3ad1876e7605fc479a92254047b2b61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/0754b11d73284474c8958740c4ecfc5eb827e21f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T21:36:47Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T21:36:47Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"message":"🐛 fix(docker): add DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY for Hoppscotch backend\n\nHoppscotch v2+ requires DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY to be present and\nexactly 32 bytes for AES-256 encryption used by InfraConfigService.\nMissing or wrong-length key causes a crash at startup.\n\nChanges:\n- Add DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY env var to hoppscotch service with a\n  32-byte default value (configurable via HOPPSCOTCH_ENCRYPTION_KEY)\n\nImpact: Hoppscotch backend starts correctly without crashing on\nInfraConfig initialization","tree":{"sha":"64f72fadecff638a8a89883ec4ab6654586bacc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/64f72fadecff638a8a89883ec4ab6654586bacc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/0754b11d73284474c8958740c4ecfc5eb827e21f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/0754b11d73284474c8958740c4ecfc5eb827e21f","node_id":"C_kwDOReiSwNoAKDA3NTRiMTFkNzMyODQ0NzRjODk1ODc0MGM0ZWNmYzVlYjgyN2UyMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/2db50ab10e8cd6998efd608c79bb3bbb4f402fe8","sha":"2db50ab10e8cd6998efd608c79bb3bbb4f402fe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/2db50ab10e8cd6998efd608c79bb3bbb4f402fe8"}],"sha":"0754b11d73284474c8958740c4ecfc5eb827e21f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/0754b11d73284474c8958740c4ecfc5eb827e21f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/2db50ab10e8cd6998efd608c79bb3bbb4f402fe8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T21:28:48Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T21:28:48Z","email":"marcelo.davanco@grupoboticario.com.br","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"message":"🐛 fix(api): fix renderPath syntax for path-to-regexp v8 compatibility\n\nThe renderPath ''/*'' syntax is invalid in path-to-regexp v8+ (used by\nExpress router in Node 24), causing a PathError at startup and crashing\nthe container.\n\nChanges:\n- Replace renderPath: ''/*'' with renderPath: ''/{*path}'' in\n  ServeStaticModule configuration\n\nImpact: container starts correctly and all React Router deep links\ncontinue to work with the named wildcard syntax","tree":{"sha":"889a7537eeea9598e7d26660883492488f6c4c64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/889a7537eeea9598e7d26660883492488f6c4c64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/2db50ab10e8cd6998efd608c79bb3bbb4f402fe8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/2db50ab10e8cd6998efd608c79bb3bbb4f402fe8","node_id":"C_kwDOReiSwNoAKDJkYjUwYWIxMGU4Y2Q2OTk4ZWZkNjA4Yzc5YmIzYmJiNGY0MDJmZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/7250cfce3b68d9c291bb88782b5bf69c795cbc0e","sha":"7250cfce3b68d9c291bb88782b5bf69c795cbc0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/7250cfce3b68d9c291bb88782b5bf69c795cbc0e"}],"sha":"2db50ab10e8cd6998efd608c79bb3bbb4f402fe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/2db50ab10e8cd6998efd608c79bb3bbb4f402fe8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/7250cfce3b68d9c291bb88782b5bf69c795cbc0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T21:21:39Z","email":"73924875+marcelo-davanco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T21:21:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"✨ feat(F34): Settings & Configuration Panel (#231)\n\nFull implementation of the F34 Settings & Configuration Panel.\n\n- Backend: ServiceLifecycleService, DockerComposeService, SettingsConfigService,\n  CryptoService, BackupService, ExportService, ImportService, AuditLogService,\n  IntegrityService (NestJS + SQLite)\n- Frontend: SettingsPage, ServiceConfigPage, BackupsPage, all components and hooks\n- Fix: SPA fallback renderPath in ServeStaticModule for React Router deep links\n- Chore: Docker socket mount, docker-compose-plugin, COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME,\n  Hoppscotch Prisma migrate init container\n- Docs: Docker testing guide","tree":{"sha":"c0bd14b255dc790cac42831d47d9d5f41a3d98c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/c0bd14b255dc790cac42831d47d9d5f41a3d98c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/7250cfce3b68d9c291bb88782b5bf69c795cbc0e","verification":{"payload":"tree c0bd14b255dc790cac42831d47d9d5f41a3d98c0\nparent bdeb7f970ac1e47e1584929c197e90918f3f0a0c\nauthor Marcelo Davanço <73924875+marcelo-davanco@users.noreply.github.com> 1773436899 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773436899 -0300\n\n✨ feat(F34): Settings & Configuration Panel (#231)\n\nFull implementation of the F34 Settings & Configuration Panel.\n\n- Backend: ServiceLifecycleService, DockerComposeService, SettingsConfigService,\n  CryptoService, BackupService, ExportService, ImportService, AuditLogService,\n  IntegrityService (NestJS + SQLite)\n- Frontend: SettingsPage, ServiceConfigPage, BackupsPage, all components and hooks\n- Fix: SPA fallback renderPath in ServeStaticModule for React Router deep links\n- Chore: Docker socket mount, docker-compose-plugin, COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME,\n  Hoppscotch Prisma migrate init container\n- Docs: Docker testing guide","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nw