Toxic,\n  AuthUser, AuditEntry, IamToken, PactContract, S3Bucket, SqsQueue,\n  StoredMockBody\n- Add mockApi namespaces: tracing, performance, protocols, events,\n  chaosNetwork, auth, iam, contracts, cloud, storage\n- Fix: remove duplicate contracts namespace\n- Add MetricsPage, TracingPage, PerformancePage\n- Add ProtocolsPage, EventsPage, ChaosNetworkPage\n- Add AuthPage, IamPage, ContractsPage\n- Add CloudPage, StoragePage\n\nImpact: All 11 remaining backend services now have frontend UI pages\n\n* ✨ feat(ui): wire 11 new service bridges, routes and navigation\n\nAdd bridge components, React Router routes, and sidebar nav groups\nfor all new services integrated in @stubrix/mock-ui.\n\nChanges:\n- Add 11 bridge components wrapping the new mock-ui pages\n- Add 11 routes in App.tsx\n- Expand Layout.tsx with 4 new nav groups: Observability,\n  Protocols, Enterprise, Cloud\n\nImpact: All new pages are accessible via sidebar navigation","tree":{"sha":"cd1e8cda89eb9813a15e829bb5961158854fa934","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/cd1e8cda89eb9813a15e829bb5961158854fa934"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/44c0a052fe9d40941e6e806e70ee5566457c205f","verification":{"payload":"tree cd1e8cda89eb9813a15e829bb5961158854fa934\nparent 1ba715cddcf2d3ab83d890807b1df24e5984b2d8\nauthor Marcelo Davanço <73924875+marcelo-davanco@users.noreply.github.com> 1773374066 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773374066 -0300\n\n✨ feat: integrate all remaining frontend services (Observability, Protocols, Enterprise, Cloud) (#228)\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): add 11 new service pages and expand mock-api client\n\nIntegrate all remaining backend services into the mock-ui micro frontend.\nExpands the API client with typed namespaces and creates full pages.\n\nChanges:\n- Add types: Trace, TraceSpan, PerformanceScript, PerformanceBaseline,\n  ProtocolMock, EventRecord, EventTemplate, ToxiProxy, Toxic,\n  AuthUser, AuditEntr