/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T03:36:06Z","email":"73924875+marcelo-davanco@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Marcelo Davanço"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T03:36:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"✨ feat(frontend): integrate all new backend services into the UI (#227)\n\n* 🐛 fix(api): fix path-to-regexp v8 wildcard syntax in route definitions\n\npath-to-regexp v8 requires named wildcards (*name) instead of\nthe deprecated anonymous wildcard (:param(*)) syntax.\n\nChanges:\n- webhooks: receive/:endpoint(*) → receive/*endpoint\n- storage: url/:bucket/:key(*) → url/:bucket/*key\n\nImpact: Resolves PathError on API startup preventing server from booting\n\n* 🐛 fix(api): remove duplicated api/ prefix from all new controllers\n\nNestJS setGlobalPrefix(''api'') already adds the /api prefix.\n18 controllers were incorrectly using @Controller(''api/...''),\nmaking all routes resolve to /api/api/... instead of /api/...\n\nChanges:\n- Removed api/ prefix from: scenarios, stateful-mocks, intelligence,\n  chaos, coverage, governance, webhooks, templates, metrics, contracts,\n  events, protocols, auth, iam, cloud, tracing, performance, chaos-network\n\nImpact: All new API endpoints now respond at the correct /api/* paths\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): expand mock-api.ts with all new backend service endpoints\n\nAdds full API client coverage for new backend modules with TypeScript types.\n\nChanges:\n- New types: ScenarioMeta, ScenarioBundle, ScenarioDiff, StatefulMock,\n  RagQueryResult, MockSuggestion, DataSuggestion, FaultRule, FaultProfile,\n  ChaosPreset, LintRule, LintResult, CoverageReport, WebhookEvent,\n  WebhookSimulation, MockTemplate, MetricsSummary\n- New API namespaces: scenarios, stateful, intelligence, chaos,\n  contracts, coverage, governance, webhooks, templates, metrics\n- Export all new types from index.ts\n\nImpact: Frontend now has full typed access to all new backend services\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): add 8 new feature pages for all integrated services\n\nCreates functional UI pages consuming the new backend API endpoints.\n\nChanges:\n- ScenariosPage: capture, restore, delete, diff between scenarios\n- StatefulMocksPage: CRUD + preview + test for DB-driven mocks\n- WebhooksPage: event inspection, replay, and simulation firing\n- ChaosPanelPage: fault profiles CRUD, toggle, preset application\n- CoveragePage: OpenAPI spec analysis via paste/upload/URL\n- GovernancePage: Spectral lint with severity badges + rules list\n- IntelligencePage: RAG query, mock generation, SQL data generation\n- TemplatesPage: list, variable config, apply parameterized templates\n\nImpact: Complete UI coverage for all new v1.4.0+ backend features\n\n* ✨ feat(ui): wire new pages into router and sidebar navigation\n\nIntegrates all new mock-ui pages into the main application shell.\n\nChanges:\n- App.tsx: add 8 new routes (scenarios, stateful, webhooks, chaos,\n  coverage, governance, intelligence, templates)\n- Layout.tsx: expand sidebar with grouped navigation (Core, Mocking,\n  Quality, Intelligence) with section labels\n- Add 8 bridge components connecting router params to page props\n\nImpact: All new features accessible from the main UI navigation","tree":{"sha":"83d28b6d0ebbccf261e6e39b62f4ec0714cfbe7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/83d28b6d0ebbccf261e6e39b62f4ec0714cfbe7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/e997bfd2ac03a98b90881ed09207f6abf7c07826","verification":{"payload":"tree 83d28b6d0ebbccf261e6e39b62f4ec0714cfbe7e\nparent dafd3aa6b25255469ab53d3403c481c8002ab8d5\nauthor Marcelo Davanço <73924875+marcelo-davanco@users.noreply.github.com> 1773372966 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773372966 -0300\n\n✨ feat(frontend): integrate all new backend services into the UI (#227)\n\n* 🐛 fix(api): fix path-to-regexp v8 wildcard syntax in route definitions\n\npath-to-regexp v8 requires named wildcards (*name) instead of\nthe deprecated anonymous wildcard (:param(*)) syntax.\n\nChanges:\n- webhooks: receive/:endpoint(*) → receive/*endpoint\n- storage: url/:bucket/:key(*) → url/:bucket/*key\n\nImpact: Resolves PathError on API startup preventing server from booting\n\n* 🐛 fix(api): remove duplicated api/ prefix from all new controllers\n\nNestJS setGlobalPrefix(''api'') already adds the /api prefix.\n18 controllers were incorrectly using @Controller(''api/...''),\nmaking all routes resolve to /api/api/... instead of /api/...\n\nChanges:\n- Removed api/ prefix from: scenarios, stateful-mocks, intelligence,\n  chaos, coverage, governance, webhooks, templates, metrics, contracts,\n  events, protocols, auth, iam, cloud, tracing, performance, chaos-network\n\nImpact: All new API endpoints now respond at the correct /api/* paths\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): expand mock-api.ts with all new backend service endpoints\n\nAdds full API client coverage for new backend modules with TypeScript types.\n\nChanges:\n- New types: ScenarioMeta, ScenarioBundle, ScenarioDiff, StatefulMock,\n  RagQueryResult, MockSuggestion, DataSuggestion, FaultRule, FaultProfile,\n  ChaosPreset, LintRule, LintResult, CoverageReport, WebhookEvent,\n  WebhookSimulation, MockTemplate, MetricsSummary\n- New API namespaces: scenarios, stateful, intelligence, chaos,\n  contracts, coverage, governance, webhooks, templates, metrics\n- Export all new types from index.ts\n\nImpact: Frontend now has full typed access to all new backend services\n\n* ✨ feat(mock-ui): add 8 new feature pages for all integrated services\n\nCreates functional UI pages consuming the new backend API endpoints.\n\nChanges:\n- ScenariosPage: capture, restore, delete, diff between scenarios\n- StatefulMocksPage: CRUD + preview + test for DB-driven mocks\n- WebhooksPage: event inspection, replay, and simulation firing\n- ChaosPanelPage: fault profiles CRUD, toggle, preset application\n- CoveragePage: OpenAPI spec analysis via paste/upload/URL\n- GovernancePage: Spectral lint with severity badges + rules list\n- IntelligencePage: RAG query, mock generation, SQL data generation\n- TemplatesPage: list, variable config, apply parameterized templates\n\nImpact: Complete UI coverage for all new v1.4.0+ backend features\n\n* ✨ feat(ui): wire new pages into router and sidebar navigation\n\nIntegrates all new mock-ui pages into the main application shell.\n\nChanges:\n- App.tsx: add 8 new routes (scenarios, stateful, webhooks, chaos,\n  coverage, governance, intelligence, templates)\n- Layout.tsx: expand sidebar with grouped navigation (Core, Mocking,\n  Quality, Intelligence) with section labels\n- Add 8 bridge components connecting router params to page props\n\nImpact: All new features accessible from the main UI navigation","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJps4YmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAf4oQAFv9JpcNnFgMv8f8gUUpjEy2\nJY6/NV0uQT5kyUTLnA2EMzwbcPr8ClmaqtMwFPrOznYALRgrX9SMHwIUsGwgKN04\nmaVqQSMorjPznWS9nsaBuy0ghCvAO9PmvzFhd0GTQIVX/OsTaBPuQPwoi8Um9XaG\n0K1oIMT9yivL6FULqTbjDBKSdMCExRr9MbfRfXfpRJSN9wKRXIuIBdWwxRRfZVfS\n9IYdkk5AwcppiT2FO2/ZDrUBmRFGuNZAofZX+VLPQqeWRGugxLrDOA5ZHO7+QuBB\nRc4izgZ+XvLRT0n9nw3LxuRkTmEdTeohaj1/idJHC2tHEPB6otwUAnDeedhT/7a7\nuNFw32ws5I2Pk5q6lO8K5OakbmW/q4aczP+NmoE6gYRlbjwwGOsOhVpq0uC2mDok\n6lqK8TlxxFWMN8zfVzU6g/rWOChgMqqHiqaPFlVoN2+0oUCBHff9XJM3t9i66vHx\numpjvPjKX09iV6yy2HBwpRy/rs7MOuctTNIBAF76me2bH946BHkPrM2zGis3uY9O\nii7Ffc5yQDpG1vR0nZn4il73wcsFOO6AB2PACk7wsd9hwFGCbD5Smxwww5i3nlX4\n1Zoah7nlQQuvVlMLmIHd4Wa5xBSzRT2Lf56wf/7J1H21R6+d7eSNSZVVk4PfB2f7\nXuhW02oy2G7Ba70wfofy\n=nMxP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-13T03:36:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_ur