RBAC, Templates (v2.1.0)\n\nImplement Wave 8 milestone covering enterprise auth, tenancy and tooling.\n\nChanges:\n- F20.01-02: AuthService — file-based user store with API key generation\n  (sbx_ prefix + 48 hex chars), default admin seeded on first boot\n- F20.03: RBAC hasPermission() — admin > editor > viewer hierarchy\n- F20.04: Workspace isolation via workspaceId field on every user\n- F20.05: AuthController — GET/POST /api/auth/users, POST /api/auth/users/:id/rotate-key,\n  DELETE /api/auth/users/:id, POST /api/auth/validate, GET /api/auth/workspaces\n- F20.06: AuditService built into AuthService — GET /api/auth/audit with\n  userId/limit filters, stores up to 1000 entries\n- F20.07: 6 MCP tools: auth_list_users, auth_create_user, auth_rotate_key,\n  auth_validate_key, auth_list_workspaces, auth_audit_log\n- F24.01: EnvironmentTemplate YAML/JSON schema with variables + mocks array\n- F24.02: 4 built-in templates: REST CRUD, Auth Flow, Paginated List, Error Scenarios\n- F24.03: TemplatesService — list (builtin + custom), create, delete, applyTemplate()\n  with {{VAR}} substitution in filenames and content\n- F24.04: CLI integration via MCP tools (template_list, template_apply, template_create)\n- F24.05: TemplatesController — GET /api/templates, GET :id, POST, DELETE :id,\n  POST :id/apply with outputDir override; 3 MCP tools\n- F18.01: packages/vscode-extension/ scaffolding with package.json, tsconfig.json\n- F18.02: MocksTreeDataProvider — sidebar tree view of projects\n  ScenariosTreeDataProvider — sidebar tree view of scenarios\n- F18.03: Commands: refreshMocks, startEngine, stopEngine, captureScenario\n- F18.04: Status bar item with engine state, polling every 30s\n- F18.05: Command palette: openDocs, doctor (health check of API+RAG+Pact)\n- Register AuthModule + TemplatesModule in AppModule with Swagger tags\n- Add auth/templates Swagger tags\n\nCloses #126, #127, #128, #129, #130, #131, #132\nCloses #139, #140, #141, #142, #143, #144, #145\nCloses #164, #165, #166, #167, #168\n\nImpact: teams can now manage users, API keys and workspaces with RBAC,\napply environment blueprints to scaffold mock sets in seconds, and\ninteract with Stubrix directly from VS Code/Windsurf IDE.","tree":{"sha":"1314e2e41e5685bbece79013be6ba70531045051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/1314e2e41e5685bbece79013be6ba70531045051"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/4b124231223ad3ebd3844b72a74a83c8e6520c50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/4b124231223ad3ebd3844b72a74a83c8e6520c50","node_id":"C_kwDOReiSwNoAKDRiMTI0MjMxMjIzYWQzZWJkMzg0NGI3MmE3NGE4M2M4ZTY1MjBjNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/c2039bab365ebce1b3fcf57fa55605f5439b2197","sha":"c2039bab365ebce1b3fcf57fa55605f5439b2197","url