celo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/47dbf8e1ccbd96b2f8bcac26175fd494868581f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T01:24:51Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T01:24:51Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"message":"✨ feat(api): F15 + F16 + F25 — GraphQL/gRPC, Events, Webhooks (v2.0.0)\n\nImplement Wave 7 milestone covering multi-protocol and event-driven features.\n\nChanges:\n- F25.01-02: WebhooksService — receive, store (up to 500), verify HMAC signature\n- F25.03: HMAC signature verification (x-hub-signature-256 / x-signature)\n- F25.04: WebhooksService.replayEvent() — replay to original or custom URL\n- F25.05: WebhooksService.createSimulation() + fireSimulation()\n- F25.06: WebhooksController:\n  POST /api/webhooks/receive/:endpoint — catch-all webhook receiver\n  GET /api/webhooks/events — list with limit/endpoint filter\n  POST /api/webhooks/events/:id/replay — replay event\n  DELETE /api/webhooks/events — clear all\n  GET/POST /api/webhooks/simulations — CRUD\n  POST /api/webhooks/simulations/:id/fire — fire simulation\n  5 MCP tools: webhook_list_events, webhook_replay, webhook_clear,\n  webhook_create_simulation, webhook_fire_simulation\n- F16.01: Redpanda Docker profile ''kafka'' (:9092 Kafka + :8082 REST + :8080 Console)\n- F16.02: RabbitMQ Docker profile ''rabbitmq'' (:5672 + :15672 management)\n- F16.03-05: EventsService — publish to Kafka (Pandaproxy REST) or RabbitMQ\n  with graceful fallback logging; file-based persistence\n- F16.06: EventTemplate CRUD + fireTemplate()\n- F16.07: EventsController — /api/events/publish, /templates, /health\n  5 MCP tools: event_publish, event_list_templates, event_create_template,\n  event_fire_template, event_health\n- F15.01: ProtocolsService — registry with file-based persistence\n- F15.02-03: parseGraphQLSchema() — extracts types/queries/mutations/subscriptions\n- F15.06: GripMock Docker profile ''gripmock'' (:4770 gRPC + :4771 stub API)\n  mocks/proto/ volume mount for .proto files\n- F15.08: ProtocolsController — /api/protocols/mocks, /graphql/parse, /grpc/health\n  4 MCP tools: protocol_list_mocks, protocol_create_mock,\n  protocol_parse_graphql, protocol_grpc_health\n- Register WebhooksModule + EventsModule + ProtocolsModule in AppModule\n- Add webhooks/events/protocols Swagger tags\n- Makefile: kafka-up/down/logs, rabbitmq-up/down/logs, gripmock-up/down\n- Add KAFKA_*, RABBITMQ_*, GRIPMOCK_* env vars to .env.example\n\nCloses #97, #98, #99, #100, #101, #102, #103, #104\nCloses #112, #113, #114, #115, #116, #117, #118\nCloses #169, #170, #171, #172, #173, #174\n\nImpact: teams can now mock GraphQL and gRPC services, publish and consume\nevents on Kafka/RabbitMQ, and test webhook integrations with capture,\nreplay and simulation from a single platform.","tree":{"sha":"10a6b514b4fdcdc8236b5c519f1e36d6e4596b48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/10a6b514b4fdcdc8236b5c519f1e36d6e4596b48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/47dbf8e1ccbd96b2f8bcac26175fd494868581f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_u