arcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/fc659927d991a10e5adb012ae672cc13d0f41e72","sha":"fc659927d991a10e5adb012ae672cc13d0f41e72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/fc659927d991a10e5adb012ae672cc13d0f41e72"}],"sha":"540743185b625247d6e37d6986ef866ae88b6700","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/540743185b625247d6e37d6986ef866ae88b6700"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/fc659927d991a10e5adb012ae672cc13d0f41e72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T01:19:04Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T01:19:04Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"message":"✨ feat(cli): F17 + F30 — @stubrix/cli package & Taskfile automation (v1.9.0)\n\nImplement Wave 6 milestone covering CLI package and Taskfile automation.\n\nChanges:\n- F17.01: @stubrix/cli npm package scaffolding with Commander.js\n- F17.02: Core commands: init, up, down, status, doctor\n  - init: creates mocks/ dirs + .env\n  - up: docker compose with --engine and --postgres flags\n  - down: stops all services with optional --volumes\n  - status: GET /api/status\n  - doctor: health check API + RAG + Pact + Toxiproxy\n- F17.03: mock sub-commands: list, create, delete, import\n- F17.04: db sub-commands: engines, snapshots, snapshot, restore\n- F17.05: chaos sub-commands: list, presets, apply, disable\n  scenario sub-commands: list, save, restore, diff, delete\n- F17.06: shared api.ts helper (apiGet, apiPost, apiDelete)\n  respects STUBRIX_API_URL env var\n- F17.07: CI/CD output mode via JSON flag on list commands\n- F30.01: Root Taskfile.yml with includes for 6 namespaced sub-files\n  tasks: default, up, down, status, doctor, build, clean\n- F30.02: taskfiles/mock.yml — mock CRUD, import, lint, coverage\n  taskfiles/db.yml — engines, snapshots, snapshot, restore\n  taskfiles/chaos.yml — list, presets, apply, disable, network-up/down\n  taskfiles/scenario.yml — list, save, restore, diff, delete\n  taskfiles/ai.yml — up, down, health, query, suggest-mock, index\n  taskfiles/infra.yml — postgres, mysql, adminer, cloudbeaver,\n  pact, hoppscotch up/down targets\n- F30.03: Taskfile covers all Makefile functionality in namespaced form\n- F30.04: packages/cli/README.md with command reference and examples\n- Add packages/cli to npm workspaces and build:cli script\n- Install commander, chalk, ora, inquirer, node-fetch as CLI deps\n\nCloses #119, #120, #121, #122, #123, #124, #125\nCloses #194, #195, #196, #197, #198\n\nImpact: developers can now control Stubrix entirely from the terminal\nwith typed commands and use Taskfile as a modern alternative to Makefile\nfor CI/CD integration and team automation.","tree":{"sha":"4106cb191db3050ab34303d696044f113b15c2a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/4106cb191db3050ab34303d696044f113b15c2a9"},"url":"http