mments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/3620da207b3480bd52339c1aca4e605524072d5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T01:10:42Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T01:10:42Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"message":"✨ feat(api): F13 + F14 + F26 — Contract Testing, Chaos Engineering, Network Chaos (v1.8.0)\n\nImplement Wave 5 milestone covering contracts, fault injection and network chaos.\n\nChanges:\n- F13.01: Pact Broker Docker Compose profile ''pact'' (:9292) backed by PostgreSQL\n- F13.04: ContractsService wrapping Pact Broker REST API with graceful fallback\n- F13.06: ContractsController — GET /api/contracts/pacts, /health,\n  /can-i-deploy?pacticipant=&version=\n- F13.07: 3 MCP tools: contract_list, contract_can_i_deploy, contract_broker_health\n- F14.01: FaultProfile + FaultRule + ChaosPreset TypeScript types\n- F14.02-03: ChaosService — CRUD profiles, file-based persistence,\n  evaluate() for real-time fault matching\n- F14.04: 4 built-in presets: slow-network, flaky-service, total-outage, timeout\n- F14.05: ChaosController — GET/POST /api/chaos/profiles, PATCH toggle,\n  DELETE, GET/POST presets, GET evaluate\n- F14.06: 5 MCP tools: chaos_list_profiles, chaos_create_profile,\n  chaos_list_presets, chaos_apply_preset, chaos_toggle_profile\n- F26.01: Toxiproxy Docker Compose profile ''toxiproxy'' (:8474 + range 8475-8485)\n- F26.02-03: ChaosNetworkService wrapping Toxiproxy REST API\n- F26.04: 4 network presets: latency, bandwidth, packet-loss, slow-close\n- F26.05: Makefile targets toxiproxy-up/down/logs, pact-up/down/logs\n- F26.06: 5 MCP tools: network_list_proxies, network_create_proxy,\n  network_apply_preset, network_list_presets, network_toxiproxy_health\n- ChaosNetworkController — proxies CRUD, toxics management, presets\n- Register ChaosModule + ContractsModule + ChaosNetworkModule in AppModule\n- Add chaos/contracts/chaos-network Swagger tags\n- Add PACT_BROKER_URL, TOXIPROXY_URL vars to .env.example\n\nCloses #78, #79, #80, #81, #82, #83\nCloses #105, #106, #107, #108, #109, #110, #111\nCloses #175, #176, #177, #178, #179, #180\n\nImpact: teams can now inject faults into mock responses for resilience\ntesting, verify consumer-provider contracts via Pact Broker, and simulate\nreal network conditions (latency, packet loss, bandwidth limits) with\nToxiproxy.","tree":{"sha":"88f5550a5c1b9ceee4313dae7ad217e0fa5f2100","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/88f5550a5c1b9ceee4313dae7ad217e0fa5f2100"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/3620da207b3480bd52339c1aca4e605524072d5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commit/3620da207b3480bd52339c1aca4e605524072d5d","node_id":"C