","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/f030987a3b9019a1e72b10f93c6ea37a0422944f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T01:00:31Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T01:00:31Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"message":"✨ feat(api): F9 + F11 — OpenRAG Intelligence Layer & Time Machine Scenarios (v1.7.0)\n\nImplement Wave 4 milestone covering AI intelligence and scenario capture.\n\nChanges:\n- F9.01: ChromaDB + OpenRAG Docker Compose profile ''ai''\n  (chromadb:8000, openrag:8888) with persistent vector storage\n- F9.02-03: IntelligenceService wrapping OpenRAG REST API with\n  graceful fallback (heuristic suggestions when offline)\n- F9.04: POST /api/intelligence/suggest/mock — NL → WireMock mapping\n- F9.05: POST /api/intelligence/suggest/data — NL → SQL seed data\n- F9.06: 5 MCP tools: rag_query, rag_suggest_mock, rag_suggest_data,\n  rag_index, rag_health\n- F9.07: IntelligenceController with /query, /suggest/mock,\n  /suggest/data, /index, /health endpoints\n- F11.01: ScenarioBundle + ScenarioMeta + ScenarioDiff TypeScript types\n- F11.02: ScenariosService.capture() — snapshots all mappings + config\n- F11.03: ScenariosService.restore() — replaces mappings from bundle\n- F11.04: ScenariosController — GET /api/scenarios, POST /capture,\n  POST /:id/restore, DELETE /:id\n- F11.05: ScenariosService.diff() — compares two bundles\n  (added/removed/modified mocks)\n- F11.06: Makefile targets scenario-save, scenario-restore, scenario-list\n- F11.07: 5 MCP tools: scenario_list, scenario_capture, scenario_restore,\n  scenario_diff, scenario_delete\n- Register IntelligenceModule + ScenariosModule in AppModule\n- Add intelligence + scenarios Swagger tags\n- Add ai-up, ai-down, ai-logs Makefile targets\n- Add OPENRAG_URL, CHROMADB_PORT, OPENAI_API_KEY to .env.example\n\nCloses #66, #67, #68, #69, #70, #71, #72\nCloses #90, #91, #92, #93, #94, #95, #96\n\nImpact: teams can now capture and restore complete environment states\nfor reproducible testing, and use AI to generate mocks and seed data\nfrom natural language descriptions via OpenRAG (with offline fallback).","tree":{"sha":"dcd1aa1ff8fc9cc5e7fe37e2ad73866513b082cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/dcd1aa1ff8fc9cc5e7fe37e2ad73866513b082cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/f030987a3b9019a1e72b10f93c6ea37a0422944f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/