"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/00ebb7af9e4f83767024b5d54bae60200ed6d16b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T00:54:27Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T00:54:27Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"message":"✨ feat(api): F12 + F19 — Spectral Lint Governance & Mock Coverage (v1.6.0)\n\nImplement Wave 3 milestone covering API governance and mock coverage.\n\nChanges:\n- F12.02: .spectral.yml with OAS ruleset + 3 custom rules:\n  stubrix-operation-id, stubrix-response-success, stubrix-no-empty-description\n- F12.03: LintService wrapping @stoplight/spectral-core programmatic API\n  with OAS ruleset, severity mapping and rule listing\n- F12.05: LintController — POST /api/governance/lint, file upload,\n  GET /api/governance/lint/rules\n- F12.06: 3 MCP tools: lint_spec, lint_mock, lint_rules\n- F19.03: CoverageService comparing OpenAPI spec endpoints vs WireMock\n  mappings with covered/partial/missing categorization\n- F19.04: Text report generator with progress bar and colored output\n- F19.05: CoverageController — POST /api/coverage/analyze (file+content),\n  GET /api/coverage/score, /missing, POST /api/coverage/report/text\n- F19.06: 4 MCP tools: coverage_report, coverage_score, coverage_missing,\n  coverage_text_report\n- Register LintModule + CoverageModule in AppModule\n- Add governance + coverage Swagger tags\n- Fix .gitignore to allow packages/api/src/coverage/ source module\n- Install @stoplight/spectral-core, spectral-formats, spectral-rulesets\n\nCloses #84, #85, #86, #87, #88, #89\nCloses #133, #134, #135, #136, #137, #138\n\nImpact: teams can now lint OpenAPI specs for compliance before creating\nmocks, and measure which spec endpoints are covered by existing mappings.","tree":{"sha":"110de8128d348af5ec4ded9445c2d5e7c01543e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/110de8128d348af5ec4ded9445c2d5e7c01543e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/00ebb7af9e4f83767024b5d54bae60200ed6d16b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.githu