"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/commits/cf621f8bbbf719a2872abea1fd6d52370f87ac89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-13T00:45:10Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-13T00:45:10Z","email":"marcelo.ceribelli@gmail.com","name":"killvorak2"},"message":"✨ feat: F23 + F7 + F8 — Universal Import, Bruno Client, Hoppscotch (v1.5.0)\n\nImplement Wave 2 milestone covering three epics.\n\nChanges:\n- F23.01: ImportIR TypeScript interface in @stubrix/shared\n- F23.02: HAR 1.2 parser with deduplication + binary body decode\n- F23.03: Postman Collection v2.1 parser with folder flattening,\n  variable resolution and body mode detection\n- F23.04: OpenAPI 3.x / Swagger 2.0 YAML+JSON parser with example\n  generation from schemas\n- F23.05: WireMockEmitter (IR -> mapping files) with jsonBody\n  serialization and path param normalization\n- F23.06: UniversalImportService (detect format, parse, emit, import\n  from URL/file/content) + UniversalImportController with endpoints:\n  POST /api/import/file, /url, /content, /preview, /formats\n- F23.07: 4 MCP tools: import_formats, import_preview, import_url,\n  import_content\n- F7.01: Bruno workspace (bruno.json + environments local/docker)\n- F7.02: Control plane collections (projects, mocks CRUD)\n- F7.03: Database collections (engines, snapshots)\n- F7.04: Recording collections (start, stop, status)\n  + stateful-mocks + import collections\n- F7.05: scripts/bruno-test.sh + @usebruno/cli devDependency\n  + make bruno-test / bruno-test-collection\n- F8.01: Hoppscotch Docker Compose profile (hoppscotch)\n- F8.02: Makefile targets hoppscotch / hoppscotch-down / hoppscotch-logs\n- F8.03: docs/hoppscotch-guide.md with setup, topology, env vars\n- Install js-yaml + @types/js-yaml for OpenAPI YAML parsing\n- Update .env.example with HOPPSCOTCH_PORT / HOPPSCOTCH_SECRET\n\nCloses #157, #158, #159, #160, #161, #162, #163\nCloses #73, #74, #75, #76, #77\nCloses #62, #63, #64, #65\n\nImpact: developers can now import any API spec (HAR/Postman/OpenAPI)\ndirectly into Stubrix, test the API with Bruno offline collections,\nand access Hoppscotch self-hosted for collaborative API testing.","tree":{"sha":"5719842ec5825c69e442221903ceedf122874fe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/5719842ec5825c69e442221903ceedf122874fe4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/cf621f8bbbf719a2872abea1fd6d52370f87ac89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_ur