10.01)\n- Add StateResolverService with parameterized queries, timeout,\n  cache layer and write-operation guard (F10.02)\n- Add TemplateEngineService (Handlebars) with helpers: json, pick,\n  first, last, eq, gt, lt, jsonPretty (F10.03)\n- Add WireMockTransformerProxyService with state resolution +\n  graceful fallback to static body on DB failure (F10.04)\n- Add StatefulMocksController: CRUD + /test + /preview (F10.05)\n- Add executeQuery() to DatabaseDriverInterface + all 3 drivers\n  (PostgresDriver via pg, MysqlDriver via mysql2, SqliteDriver via\n  better-sqlite3) (F10.02)\n- Install pg + @types/pg dependencies\n- Install handlebars dependency\n- Register StatefulMocksModule in AppModule\n- Add 7 MCP tools: stateful_mock_create/list/get/update/delete/test/preview (F10.06)\n- Add 27 unit tests covering service + template engine (F10.01 AC)\n\nCloses #56, #57, #58, #59, #60, #61\n\nImpact: mocks can now respond with live database data rendered\nthrough Handlebars templates — zero static stubs for stateful APIs.","tree":{"sha":"62673a865f59e73b40b477b25b6a365f29e5e266","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/trees/62673a865f59e73b40b477b25b6a365f29e5e266"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcelo-davanco/stubrix/git/commits/73cf99998e6e833d0241f70396cdba6ce84e4085","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73924875?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcelo-davanco/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/marcelo-davanco","id":73924875,"login":"marcelo-davanco","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTI0ODc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user