ohansson/Portal/commits/400da657e37134c5953b42cea47a394795fb5905/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:49:25Z","email":"lars.m.johansson@gmail.com","name":"Lars M Johansson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:49:25Z","email":"lars.m.johansson@gmail.com","name":"Lars M Johansson"},"message":"Fix runtime Module Federation issues found in browser verification\n\nTwo defects that all four production builds + the backend test suite\npassed clean, but which broke at runtime when the shell actually loaded\nthe remotes in a browser:\n\n- PluginLoader registered remotes as type ''module'' (Vite/ESM-era), but\n  @module-federation/rsbuild-plugin emits a ''global''-format remoteEntry.js\n  (mf-manifest.json → remoteEntry.type === \"global\"). The mismatch surfaced\n  as Federation RUNTIME-002 \"remote entry interface does not contain init\"\n  and the MFE failed to mount. Register with type ''global''.\n\n- mfe-hello''s rsbuild.config used `const config: RsbuildConfig = {…};\n  export default config` instead of `defineConfig({…})`. The plain object\n  skips Rsbuild''s config normalization that wires dev.assetPrefix into the\n  Module Federation publicPath, so the dev manifest reported publicPath \"/\"\n  and Hello''s async chunks were fetched from the shell origin (3000) →\n  ChunkLoadError. Use defineConfig like the other MFEs.\n\nVerified in-browser (Keycloak login → Home/Dashboard/Hello render with\nTailwind styles; client-side nav between all three MFEs; zero console /\npage / React-duplication errors).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13522e936a93d1a1d9c3e9f8eaf06674343feee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/git/trees/13522e936a93d1a1d9c3e9f8eaf06674343feee2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/git/commits/400da657e37134c5953b42cea47a394795fb5905","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31507377?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/larsmjoh","id":31507377,"login":"larsmjoh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTA3Mzc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LMJohansson/Portal/commit/400da657e37134c5953b42cea47a394795fb5905","node_id":"C_kwDORetr3NoAKDQwMGRhNjU3ZTM3MTM0YzU5NTNiNDJjZWE0N2EzOTQ3OTVmYjU5MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LMJohansson/Portal/commit/2b22a2042a5b84ea52c62804454b407e38aa06ca","sha":"2b22a2042a5b84ea52c62804454b407e38aa06ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/commits/2b22a2042a5b84ea52c62804454b407e38aa06ca"}],"sha":"400da657e37134c5953b42cea47a394795fb5905","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/commits/400da657e37134c5953b42cea47a394795fb5905"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31507377?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/larsmjoh","id":31507377,"login":"larsmjoh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTA3Mzc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/commits/2b22a2042a5b84ea52c62804454b407e38aa06ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:15:33Z","email":"lars.m.johansson@gmail.com","name":"Lars M Johansson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:15:33Z","email":"lars.m.johansson@gmail.com","name":"Lars M Johansson"},"message":"Migrate build Vite → Rspack/Rsbuild and update all dependencies\n\nReplace the Vite + @module-federation/vite build with Rsbuild + Rspack\nModule Federation across the shell and three MFEs, finish the\nbridge-react host/remote migration, and bump frontend and backend\ndependencies to their latest releases.\n\nBuild / Module Federation:\n- Each app gets an rsbuild.config.ts (pluginModuleFederation +\n  createModuleFederationConfig) replacing vite.config.ts. Removes both\n  Vite workarounds: the fixMF2CjsNaming string hack and\n  vite-plugin-css-injected-by-js (MFEs now use output.injectStyles so\n  their Tailwind styles travel with the federated chunk).\n- remoteEntry.js still emits at dist root, so DB seed URLs and nginx\n  configs are unchanged.\n- nmHoistingLimits: workspaces so the bridge-react webpack plugin can\n  resolve bridge-react/react-router from each app''s node_modules and\n  wire up its router-v7 aliases.\n\nBridge / routing:\n- MFEs import createBridgeComponent from bridge-react/v19 and\n  BrowserRouter from bridge-react/router-v7; shell consumes via\n  createRemoteAppComponent. react-router declared explicitly so the\n  bridge re-exports router-core primitives without a cycle.\n\nDependencies (latest majors):\n- react-router 6→7, zustand 4→5, typescript 5→6, eslint 8→10 (flat\n  config + unified typescript-eslint), lucide 0→1, bridge-react/runtime\n  2.6, React 19.2, plus tanstack/axios/oidc bumps.\n- Env vars renamed VITE_* → PUBLIC_*.\n\nBackend:\n- Quarkus 3.27 → 3.33 LTS; maven compiler/surefire/failsafe bumps;\n  Keycloak 26.0 → 26.6.3; Node pin → v24.17.0.\n- Add an explicit %test H2 datasource (3.33 no longer auto-resolves one\n  with two JDBC drivers present) and make a plugin-id test extraction\n  version-robust (getLong).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7356e3f2b0ea98cb4f3309e8552034f325fb28fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/git/trees/7356e3f2b0ea98cb4f3309e8552034f325fb28fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/git/commits/2b22a2042a5b84ea52c62804454b407e38aa06ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31507377?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/larsmjoh","id":31507377,"login":"larsmjoh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTA3Mzc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LMJohansson/Portal/commit/2b22a2042a5b84ea52c62804454b407e38aa06ca","node_id":"C_kwDORetr3NoAKDJiMjJhMjA0MmE1Yjg0ZWE1MmM2MjgwNDQ1NGI0MDdlMzhhYTA2Y2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LMJohansson/Portal/commit/9f55d2564d68e72d1f4d012350f64d057ce22a12","sha":"9f55d2564d68e72d1f4d012350f64d057ce22a12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/commits/9f55d2564d68e72d1f4d012350f64d057ce22a12"}],"sha":"2b22a2042a5b84ea52c62804454b407e38aa06ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/commits/2b22a2042a5b84ea52c62804454b407e38aa06ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31507377?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/larsmjoh","id":31507377,"login":"larsmjoh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTA3Mzc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/commits/9f55d2564d68e72d1f4d012350f64d057ce22a12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T10:27:26Z","email":"lars.m.johansson@gmail.com","name":"Lars M Johansson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T10:59:08Z","email":"lars.m.johansson@gmail.com","name":"Lars M Johansson"},"message":"Simplify and isolate MFE Docker builds; fix peer dependency warnings\n\n- Switch all frontend Dockerfiles from quay.io images to docker.io\n  standard images (node:24-alpine, nginx:stable-alpine), removing the\n  USER root and ulimit workarounds that were RHEL-image-specific\n- Make each MFE Dockerfile fully self-contained: copy only its own\n  package.json, install standalone (no workspace stubs), build in\n  isolation — shell and MFEs are completely unaware of each other at\n  build time\n- Move vite-plugin-css-injected-by-js from root devDependencies into\n  each MFE''s own devDependencies (was only available via hoisting)\n- Remove hardcoded /home fallback from IndexRedirect — shell no longer\n  encodes knowledge of any specific MFE route\n- Fix peer dependency warnings via packageExtensions in .yarnrc.yml:\n  @module-federation/vite and @typescript-eslint/utils both fail to\n  re-declare typescript as a peer, breaking downstream resolution chains\n- Update Makefile k8s-pull to reference the images actually in use\n- Update README: MFE independence design decision, per-MFE CSS plugin\n  ownership, corrected \"Adding a new MFE\" step 3\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Lars M Johansson <lars.m.johansson@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdcac0c09a858b0c26901d2aaa802459b7528668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/git/trees/fdcac0c09a858b0c26901d2aaa802459b7528668"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/git/commits/9f55d2564d68e72d1f4d012350f64d057ce22a12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31507377?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmjoh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h