oh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lars M. Johansson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T10:59:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Upgrade Tailwind CSS v3 → v4 (#2)\n\n- Replace postcss plugin with @tailwindcss/vite in all four workspaces\n- Delete tailwind.config.js and postcss.config.js from each workspace\n- Replace @tailwind base/components/utilities with @import \"tailwindcss\"\n- Move brand color palette from tailwind.config.js to @theme block in index.css\n- Remove autoprefixer and postcss devDependencies (handled natively by v4)\n\nSigned-off-by: Lars M Johansson <lars.m.johansson@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0962f39413516460e3109241ae8fa092f69e138","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/git/trees/e0962f39413516460e3109241ae8fa092f69e138"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LMJohansson/Portal/git/commits/26fb25c6cc2a4c7a41694cef7f6785799673d9b7","verification":{"payload":"tree e0962f39413516460e3109241ae8fa092f69e138\nparent c535f8fe47f804e4f4cc2b8848e6287be6995f94\nauthor Lars M. Johansson <31507377+larsmjoh@users.noreply.github.com> 1772794760 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772794760 +0100\n\nUpgrade Tailwind CSS v3 → v4 (#2)\n\n- Replace postcss plugin with @tailwindcss/vite in all four workspaces\n- Delete tailwind.config.js and postcss.config.js from each workspace\n- Replace @tailwind base/components/utilities with @import \"tailwindcss\"\n- Move brand color palette from tailwind.config.js to @theme block in index.css\n- Remove autoprefixer and postcss devDependencies (handled natively by v4)\n\nSigned-off-by: Lars M Johansson <lars.m.johansson@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqrOICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEC4QADi8asylqPYkVluHA2KOutSa\n8983mbtBs6S4qqni3ksGFSJq7yvpGCTJu+/w6CnM2hGMXXeS1iCp6QV0H6UwdOWT\nrT4l+nunr4jfPkj