thub.com/users/tanishmisra9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commits/929d03ab2a8c153c1eed96f075b247aefa276c8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:25:21Z","email":"tanishmisra9@gmail.com","name":"Tanish Misra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:25:21Z","email":"tanishmisra9@gmail.com","name":"Tanish Misra"},"message":"Use dynamic PORT for Railway compatibility\n\nRailway assigns a dynamic port via the PORT environment variable. Updated the Dockerfile and docker-compose.yml entrypoints to use ${PORT:-8501} so the app listens on Railway''s assigned port in production while still defaulting to 8501 for local development.","tree":{"sha":"eed6eb97e36628bbba3c8d48a413e94758fc6e90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/git/trees/eed6eb97e36628bbba3c8d48a413e94758fc6e90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/git/commits/929d03ab2a8c153c1eed96f075b247aefa276c8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175744515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9","id":175744515,"login":"tanishmisra9","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmmAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commit/929d03ab2a8c153c1eed96f075b247aefa276c8f","node_id":"C_kwDORevjBtoAKDkyOWQwM2FiMmE4YzE1M2MxZWVkOTZmMDc1YjI0N2FlZmEyNzZjOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commit/71bbbee9e0d11f5a4e5dea717d94dc8d0a0f10a6","sha":"71bbbee9e0d11f5a4e5dea717d94dc8d0a0f10a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commits/71bbbee9e0d11f5a4e5dea717d94dc8d0a0f10a6"}],"sha":"929d03ab2a8c153c1eed96f075b247aefa276c8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commits/929d03ab2a8c153c1eed96f075b247aefa276c8f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175744515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9","id":175744515,"login":"tanishmisra9","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmmAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commits/71bbbee9e0d11f5a4e5dea717d94dc8d0a0f10a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:17:32Z","email":"tanishmisra9@gmail.com","name":"Tanish Misra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T02:17:32Z","email":"tanishmisra9@gmail.com","name":"Tanish Misra"},"message":"Harden codebase for production deployment\n\nAddressed 20 failure modes identified by audit. All exception messages displayed in the Streamlit UI are now sanitized to strip API keys, credentials, and connection strings before rendering. SQL LIKE injection is prevented by escaping wildcard characters in search inputs. CSV uploads are bounded to 200 MB to prevent OOM kills. The SharedContext singleton race condition is fixed by storing context per Streamlit session instead of sharing a global instance. Canonical record selection in LoaderAgent is now fully deterministic with tiebreakers on name length and alphabetical order. Alembic migration infrastructure is added with an initial schema migration that runs automatically on container startup. Session scope safety is improved with a rollback in the finally block and connection pool tuning (pool_recycle, pool_size, max_overflow). Blocking-based deduplication now uses three strategies (sorted tokens, first token, tax_id) to reduce missed duplicates, and within-block matching uses rapidfuzz batch operations for a significant speedup. LLM prompt injection is mitigated by truncating vendor fields to 200 characters, stripping control characters, and adding a system message guardrail. Bulk inserts are wrapped in a single transaction so partial failures roll back cleanly. VendorCheckAgent no longer loads the entire vendor master into memory, instead fetching a small candidate set via targeted SQL queries. An optional password authentication gate is added via REQUIRE_AUTH and APP_PASSWORD environment variables. Audit logging now supports a strict mode that re-raises write failures instead of silently swallowing them. The Docker healthcheck is fixed to use Python''s urllib instead of curl, which isn''t available in the slim image. All datetime.utcnow calls are replaced with datetime.now(timezone.utc) for Python 3.12+ compatibility. MySQL connection initialization retries with exponential backoff to handle container startup races. Analyst override buttons now persist state across Streamlit reruns via session_state. Context truncation is no longer silent, logging a warning and setting a flag when matching history exceeds the cap. The Add Vendor form validates tax_id (EIN format), ZIP (5 or 9 digit), and state (2-letter code) before submission.","tree":{"sha":"7b30966e5cc654978d18ae36de284f0e8b2ddfb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/git/trees/7b30966e5cc654978d18ae36de284f0e8b2ddfb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/git/commits/71bbbee9e0d11f5a4e5dea717d94dc8d0a0f10a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175744515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9","id":175744515,"login":"tanishmisra9","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmmAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commit/71bbbee9e0d11f5a4e5dea717d94dc8d0a0f10a6","node_id":"C_kwDORevjBtoAKDcxYmJiZWU5ZTBkMTFmNWE0ZTVkZWE3MTdkOTRkYzhkMGEwZjEwYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commit/d141fd51ca7214afdbd93e4a77bf1bb008409947","sha":"d141fd51ca7214afdbd93e4a77bf1bb008409947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commits/d141fd51ca7214afdbd93e4a77bf1bb008409947"}],"sha":"71bbbee9e0d11f5a4e5dea717d94dc8d0a0f10a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commits/71bbbee9e0d11f5a4e5dea717d94dc8d0a0f10a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175744515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9","id":175744515,"login":"tanishmisra9","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmmAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commits/d141fd51ca7214afdbd93e4a77bf1bb008409947/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T01:56:45Z","email":"tanishmisra9@gmail.com","name":"Tanish Misra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T01:56:45Z","email":"tanishmisra9@gmail.com","name":"Tanish Misra"},"message":"Initial commit: Agentic Vendor Master Assistant\n\nMulti-agent vendor data management system with LangGraph orchestration,\nOpenAI GPT-4 deduplication, and Streamlit analyst UI. Includes batch\npipeline with live progress, column validation, blocking-based fuzzy\nmatching at scale, and full audit logging.","tree":{"sha":"cd285044c8af836abb05c1dc22a66da6028a66bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/git/trees/cd285044c8af836abb05c1dc22a66da6028a66bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/git/commits/d141fd51ca7214afdbd93e4a77bf1bb008409947","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175744515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9","id":175744515,"login":"tanishmisra9","node_id":"U_kgDOCnmmAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tanishmisra9","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tanishmisra9/VendorOrchestrator/commit/d141fd51ca7214afdbd93e4a77bf1bb008409947","