/wiqilee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wiqilee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wiqilee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wiqilee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wiqilee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wiqilee/VoxGuard/commits/32ab287e3582989a6c07273734c6e71931ab25af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T09:37:20Z","email":"wiqilee@gmail.com","name":"wiqilee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T09:37:20Z","email":"wiqilee@gmail.com","name":"wiqilee"},"message":"docs: README updated with lie detection, language support table, SVG\n\nREADME (390→468 lines):\n- Comparison table: +5 rows (lie detection, 2-way, vulnerability, gallery, actions)\n- Feature 5: Psych expanded with 3 frameworks + interpretation rubric\n- Feature 6 NEW: Lie Detection (5 FBI CBCA indicators with table)\n- Feature 7 NEW: Two-Way Communication Transcript\n- Feature 8: Gallery + forensic export expanded\n- Feature 9: Full language support table — 9 native (with flags) + 30 English fallback\n- Feature 10 NEW: Responsive Design\n- Limitations: accurate (browser TTS, mute, 9 native vs 30+ fallback)\n- Future Work: +5 items (deepfake, auto-detect, natural TTS, emotional contagion)\n- Privacy: no brand names noted\n\nSVG:\n- lie-detection.svg: animated bars with FBI methodology label","tree":{"sha":"7ff34052ab49d538488ca03ccd25142f4d4532fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wiqilee/VoxGuard/git/trees/7ff34052ab49d538488ca03ccd25142f4d4532fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wiqilee/VoxGuard/git/commits/32ab287e3582989a6c07273734c6e71931ab25af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225555971?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wiqilee/events{/privacy}