://api.github.com/users/Faribro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faribro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faribro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faribro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faribro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Faribro/TB-PWA/commits/e2a57755b97c409770302e89576b1215abbdabbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T16:40:35Z","email":"faridsayyed1010@gmail.com","name":"Faribro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T16:40:35Z","email":"faridsayyed1010@gmail.com","name":"Faribro"},"message":"fix(auth): remove module-level throw — AUTH_SECRET unavailable at build time\n\nNextAuth v5 initialises when the module is first required(). Vercel''s build\nphase sets NODE_ENV=production but does NOT inject runtime secrets, so the\nexplicit throw was crashing ''Collecting page data'' for every route that\nimports from @/auth.\n\nFix: remove the throw entirely. NextAuth is given undefined for the secret at\nbuild time — it initialises silently. At runtime Vercel supplies the real\nAUTH_SECRET and tokens are signed/verified normally.","tree":{"sha":"381b8c864cf9e60c5fc32c7e896093f207b1d894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Faribro/TB-PWA/git/trees/381b8c864cf9e60c5fc32c7e896093f207b1d894"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Faribro/TB-PWA/git/commits/e2a57755b97c409770302e89576b1215abbdabbb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49672595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faribro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faribro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faribro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faribro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","