0d382d7386e614442d538c0fd8ac4feddc387/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T09:37:48Z","email":"deki.riana@megasyariah.co.id","name":"Deki Riana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T09:37:48Z","email":"deki.riana@megasyariah.co.id","name":"Deki Riana"},"message":"Mengimplementasikan arsitektur Micro-Frontend Auth tersentralisasi dengan mengekspos AuthCore dari React Host sebagai shared singleton yang terintegrasi penuh pada kedua remote. Pada remote Vue (The Feed), ditambahkan role-based access control (RBAC) menggunakan composable useAuth untuk mengamankan akses fitur Create Post. Sementara itu, remote Angular (The Board) direfaktor secara masif ke standar Angular 21 (Signals, Zoneless, dan modern control flow), mencakup pembuatan directive *appCan yang reaktif untuk mengelola otorisasi aksi CRUD pada Issue Panel, serta integrasi konfigurasi environment dinamis (.env via dotenv) di seluruh repositori untuk skalabilitas deployment.","tree":{"sha":"ca98b8d4d533e06b8a76d09188de9a2ecbf967bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dekiriana/micro-frontend/git/trees/ca98b8d4d533e06b8a76d09188de9a2ecbf967bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dekiriana/micro-frontend/git/commits/be20d382d7386e614442d538c0fd8ac4feddc387","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/dekiriana/micro-frontend/commit/be20d382d7386e614442d538c0fd8ac4feddc387","node_id":"C_kwDORfAJ-doAKGJlMjBkMzgyZDczODZlNjE0NDQyZDUzOGMwZmQ4YWM0ZmVkZGMzODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dekiriana/micro-frontend/commit/f8c177e5c099370833a70fc29f01cec835b8437b","sha":"f8c177e5c099370833a70fc29f01cec835b8437b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dekiriana/micro-frontend/commits/f8c177e5c099370833a70fc29f01cec835b8437b"}],"sha":"be20d382d7386e614442d538c0fd8ac4feddc387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dekiriana/micro-frontend/commits/be20d382d7386e614442d538c0fd8ac4fe