mina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T11:36:37Z","email":"yasindunethmina1938096@gmail.com","name":"yasindunethmina"},"message":"module federation monorepo with zephyr cloud\n\n- three independently deployed micro-frontends: shell (host), dashboard (remote), design-system (remote)\n- design system exposes 17 federated modules: 15 shadcn/ui components + recharts + utils\n- dashboard consumes design-system via MF and exposes itself as a single module\n- shell loads dashboard lazily via react.lazy + suspense with MF-aware error boundaries\n- zephyr:dependencies with @* for dynamic remote resolution at build time - no hardcoded URLs\n- withZephyr() on all apps handles auth, edge deployment, and remote URL resolution\n- shared react/react-dom singletons across all remotes to prevent duplicate instances\n- tailwind css v4 with shared theme in design-system, imported by each app\n- github actions workflow: auto-deploys on push to main, preview environments on PRs\n- biome for linting and formatting across the monorepo","tree":{"sha":"ddfac1d6d7f713078e4aa2dc485679871fde9edf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasindunethmina/zephyr-mf-dashboard/git/trees/ddfac1d6d7f713078e4aa2dc485679871fde9edf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasindunethmina/zephyr-mf-dashboard/git/commits/a8914f7e2980a170cccb481ee3c3095fe1dc4bb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65332290?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasindunethmina/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasindunethmina/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasindunethmina/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasindunethmina/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasindunethmina","id":65332290,"login":"yasindunethmina","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MzMyMjkw","organiza