bscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartsolutionslab/yumney/commits/2b84465092fd5d178b0f46b05fff3b1abc6b16ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T15:08:38Z","email":"heiko@smartsolutionslab.tech","name":"Heiko Weiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:50:02Z","email":"heiko@smartsolutionslab.tech","name":"notonlywhite"},"message":"refactor(shell): enable standalone mode for micro-frontends\n\nMove HeaderComponent from shell to libs/ui as a shared component.\nCreate AppLayoutComponent that conditionally renders the header based\non IS_STANDALONE token — when the MFE is loaded inside the shell\n(detected via yn-root in DOM), the header is hidden since the shell\nprovides it. When running standalone on its own port, the MFE shows\nits own header with full navigation.\n\n- Move header component to libs/ui/src/lib/header/\n- Create AppLayoutComponent in libs/ui/src/lib/app-layout/\n- Create IS_STANDALONE injection token in shared/models\n- Update recipes, shopping, account root components to use AppLayout\n- Add layout.header i18n keys (EN + DE) to all MFE translation files\n- Delete old header files from shell, update imports to @yumney/ui\n\nEach MFE now works two ways:\n1. Standalone: localhost:420x shows full app with header + nav\n2. Federated: loaded inside shell, header hidden (shell provides it)","tree":{"sha":"8d05bc82b5cd075b259844d0f08c1c00eed6cfa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartsolutionslab/yumney/git/trees/8d05bc82b5cd075b259844d0f08c1c00eed6cfa7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartsolutionslab/yumney/git/commits/2b84465092fd5d178b0f46b05fff3b1abc6b16ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217957015?v=4