notonlywhite","node_id":"U_kgDODP3Clw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartsolutionslab/yumney/commits/4de4e500e943e6b2c15da34ab52b2812ea25a7af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T14:52:04Z","email":"heiko@smartsolutionslab.tech","name":"Heiko Weiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:50:02Z","email":"heiko@smartsolutionslab.tech","name":"notonlywhite"},"message":"test(e2e): scaffold Playwright E2E project with auth page tests\n\nSet up apps/shell-e2e with Playwright configuration, auto-detected by\nthe @nx/playwright plugin already configured in nx.json.\n\nAdd page objects for login, register, and resend-verification pages.\nAdd E2E specs covering:\n- Login: rendering, checkbox toggle, navigation, page title\n- Register: form validation (required, email, password, mismatch),\n  successful registration with mocked API, error handling (409, 500),\n  navigation to resend-verification\n- Resend Verification: form validation, success with mocked API,\n  error handling, back navigation\n\nTests use Playwright route interception to mock API responses,\nrequiring only the Angular dev servers — no Keycloak needed.\n\nRun with: nx e2e shell-e2e (starts all 4 dev servers automatically)","tree":{"sha":"0f868316e3df9afd1668812df0d0d574c11b9153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartsolutionslab/yumney/git/trees/0f868316e3df9afd1668812df0d0d574c11b9153"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartsolutionslab/yumney/git/commits/4de4e500e943e6b2c15da34ab52b281