}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/notonlywhite","id":217957015,"login":"notonlywhite","node_id":"U_kgDODP3Clw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notonlywhite","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartsolutionslab/yumney/commits/ed3b981f9e01cb94641460f75fb57371e1cd9311/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T13:55:59Z","email":"heiko@smartsolutionslab.tech","name":"Heiko Weiss"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T16:50:50Z","email":"heiko@smartsolutionslab.tech","name":"notonlywhite"},"message":"refactor(shared): split Yumney.Shared into 4 layer-aligned projects (US-000)\n\nSplit the monolithic Yumney.Shared into separate assemblies to enforce\narchitectural boundaries at the project level:\n- Yumney.Shared: Common DDD base classes (Entity, AggregateRoot, Result)\n- Yumney.Shared.Guards: Ensure.That() validation (standalone, no deps)\n- Yumney.Shared.CQRS: ICommand/IQuery handler interfaces (standalone)\n- Yumney.Shared.Events: Event dispatchers and bus (depends on Shared)\n\nDomain projects can now only reference Common + Guards, never CQRS or\nEvents. Architecture tests enforce these new boundaries.","tree":{"sha":"bf275df58badd467b2d314b5e5ac4c2810bd5c1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartsolutionslab/yumney/git/trees/bf275df58badd467b2d314b5e5ac4c2810bd5c1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smartsolutionslab/yumney/git/commits/ed3b981f9e01cb94641460f75fb57371e1cd9311","verification":{"payload":null,"reason"