 Marketing, Retail)\n  with 16 common roles like CEO/Founder, Head of Supply Chain, etc.\n- Supports keyboard navigation (arrow keys, Enter, Escape) and click selection\n- Already-selected roles are filtered out of suggestions\n- Users can still type custom roles and press Enter\n- Results header (Saved, Emails, Find More, Export, Outbound) now left-aligned\n  with consistent spacing instead of right-aligned with nested wrappers","tree":{"sha":"c6c1e829f95365cc66df2190e46b262e10649e64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celinepyun-ops/gallop-ai/git/trees/c6c1e829f95365cc66df2190e46b262e10649e64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celinepyun-ops/gallop-ai/git/commits/05e26eefc3b00a8280bb8edd19bd33df3ba17189","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262822201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/celinepyun-ops","id":262822201,"login":"celinepyun-ops","node_id":"U_kgDOD6pZOQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/celinepyun-ops","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/celinepyun-ops/gallop-ai/commit/05e26eefc3b00a8280bb8edd19bd33df3ba17189","node_id":"C_kwDORfkAq9oAKDA1ZTI2ZWVmYzNiMDBhODI4MGJiOGVk