ub.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ifBars/MLVInspector/commits/28bca1a747a4c05d980a9bea2f0d8bd8eafeefa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T10:27:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T10:27:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"refactor: split monolithic app.rs into src/components/ modules\n\nExtracts the 2280-line app.rs into focused, independently maintainable\ncomponents under src/components/:\n\n- theme.rs          — design tokens + global_css() builder\n- view_models.rs    — UI-facing types (UiMethod, IlTab, ViewMode, …)\n- resize.rs         — ResizeTarget, ActiveResize, clamp_panel_width\n- helpers.rs        — pure functions (extract_methods/findings, grouping, etc.)\n- analysis.rs       — run_analysis background task\n- title_bar.rs      — draggable title bar with toolbar + window controls\n- status_bar.rs     — bottom metrics / error bar\n- assemblies_panel.rs — left panel: open assembly list\n- explorer_panel.rs   — middle panel: namespace/type/method tree\n- il_view_panel.rs    — center panel: IL viewer + C# decompiler tabs\n- findings_panel.rs   — right panel: scan findings list + detail pane\n\napp.rs is now a thin ~360-line composition that owns shared cross-panel\nsignals (open_tabs, active_tab_id, highlighted_il_offset, etc.) and wires\nthe four resizable panels together. Each panel uses use_context::<AppState>()\nfor global state and accepts only the signals it actually needs.\n\nNo behaviour changes; the fix also correctly removes the broken CSS\ninterpolation for FONT_MONO by using format!() in global_css().\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_013UifMt4xVPN6XG2T4zeimt","tree":{"sha":"70d186e2838e48f47f407f342f38831fb478a04c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ifBars/MLVInspector/git/trees/70d186e2838e48f47f407f342f38831fb478a04c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ifBars/MLVInspector/git/commits/28bca1a747a4c05d980a9bea2f0d8bd8eafeefa1","verification":{"payload":"tree 70d186e2838e48f47f407f342f38831fb478a04c\nparent af42b689d7ebcc66e270a12402170e5d172dfe93\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772792865 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772792865 +0000\n\nrefactor: split monolithic app.rs into src/components/ modules\n\nExtracts the 2280-line app.rs into focused, independently maintainable\ncomponents under src/components/:\n\n- theme.rs          — design tokens + global_css() builder\n- view_models.rs    — UI-facing types (UiMethod, IlTab, ViewMode, …)\n- resize.rs         — ResizeTarget, ActiveResize, clamp_panel_width\n- helpers.rs        — pure functions (extract_methods/findings, grouping, etc.)\n- analysis.rs       — run_analysis background task\n- title_bar.rs      — draggable title bar with toolbar + window controls\n- status_bar.rs     — bottom metrics / error bar\n- assemblies_panel.rs — left panel: open assembly list\n- explorer_panel.rs   — middle panel: namespace/type/method tree\n- il_view_panel.rs    — center panel: IL viewer + C# decompiler tabs\n- findings_panel.rs   — right panel: scan findings list + detail pane\n\napp.rs is now a thin ~360-line composition that owns shared cross-panel\nsignals (open_tabs, active_tab_id, highlighted_il_offset, etc.) and wires\nthe four resizable panels together. Each panel uses use_context::<AppState>()\nfor global state and accepts only the signals it actually needs.\n\nNo behaviour changes; the fix also correctly removes the broken CSS\ninterpolation for FONT_MONO by using format!() in global_css().\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_013UifMt4xVPN6XG2T4zeimt\n","reason":"valid","signatur