vide on-demand decompilation of .NET assemblies back\nto readable C# source code.\n\nChanges:\n- Worker: add ICSharpCode.Decompiler 8.2 NuGet dependency\n- Worker: add DecompileParams / DecompilePayload protocol types with\n  JSON source-generator registration\n- Worker: add Dispatcher.Decompile() using CSharpDecompiler — supports\n  per-method, per-type, and whole-assembly decompilation; handles\n  Mono.Cecil nested-type separator (''/'') → reflection format (''+'')\n  conversion; wraps all decompiler calls in try/catch for robustness\n- Worker: route \"decompile\" IPC method in Program.cs dispatcher\n- Rust: add DecompileParams / DecompilePayload to ipc.rs\n- Rust: add WorkerClient.decompile() in worker_client.rs\n- UI (app.rs): add IL / C# toggle pill in the IL View panel header;\n  add reactive use_effect that fires on tab/assembly change while in\n  C# mode to trigger decompilation; cache results keyed by\n  \"assembly::type::method\" to avoid redundant requests; render\n  decompiled source in a pre block with loading / empty states\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01MWrX5hHUsTXUdEmR255QPi","tree":{"sha":"1928f41ea2a7cbb0af160feb091fb15fc95cb734","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ifBars/MLVInspector/git/trees/1928f41ea2a7cbb0af160feb091fb15fc95cb734"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ifBars/MLVInspector/git/commits/65f904e9ff4a67ddb2872441052420e8fc2e5a9b","verification":{"payload":"tree 1928f41ea2a7cbb0af160feb091fb15fc95cb734\nparent 864fc17abd7fc152b941be032553d87404322edd\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772791403 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1772791403 +0000\n\nAdd full C# reconstruction via ICSharpCode.Decompiler\n\nIntegrates ICSharpCode.Decompiler (the engine behind ILSpy/dnSpy) into\nthe C# worker to provide on-demand decompilation of .NET assemblies back\nto readable C# source code.\n\nChanges:\n- Worker: add ICSharpCode.Decompiler 8.2 NuGet dependency\n- Worker: add DecompileParams / DecompilePayload protocol types with\n  JSON source-generator registration\n- Worker: add Dispatcher.Decompile() using CSharpDecompiler — supports\n  per-method, per-type, and whole-assembly decompilation; handles\n  Mono.Cecil nested-type separator (''/'') → reflection format (''+'')\n  conversion; wraps all decompiler calls in try/catch for robustness\n- Worker: route \"decompile\" IPC method in Program.cs dispatcher\n- Rust: add DecompileParams / DecompilePayload to ipc.rs\n- Rust: add WorkerClient.decompile() in worker_client.rs\n- UI (app.rs): add IL / C# toggle pill in the IL View panel header;\n  add reactive use_effect that fires on tab/assembly change while in\n  C# mode to trigger decompilation; cache results keyed by\n  \"assembly::type::method\" to avoid redundant requests; render\n  decompiled source in a pre block with loading / empty states\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01MWrX5hHUsTXUdEmR255QPi\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFZLdlnq\nFVbg93tzj+S2NHzSUjNXq7BjKT6yeOGYphwCJp0saiiTxcjTieDs2dr9cL2sxVjYNF3Abvnxib8I\noQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-06T10:03:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us