blic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vibeoski/homejira/commits/91123818bfc7b74b5aa69b176a5ac28189c1fe19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T11:07:59Z","email":"adarsh97vtk@gmail.com","name":"vibeoski"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T11:07:59Z","email":"adarsh97vtk@gmail.com","name":"vibeoski"},"message":"feat: aurora design system, stats overhaul, grocery UX redesign\n\nDesign system:\n- Aurora/mesh gradient background on onboarding, auth, household setup screens\n- AppLayout background updated to layered radial-gradients for subtle app-wide aurora\n- Top bar, bottom nav, sub-headers remain white — warm neutral chrome\n- HouseholdPanel setup screen: aurora treatment with full-height containment\n- HouseholdPanel hero header: warm indigo (#eef2ff) with aurora blob\n\nModals — desktop center / mobile bottom-sheet:\n- AddTaskSheet, AddGrocerySheet, EditGrocerySheet (now DetailSheet), AccountMenu (all 4 panels)\n  now use useBreakpoint to switch between bottom-sheet (mobile) and centered dialog (desktop)\n- Desktop: borderRadius 16, fade-in animation, box-shadow, no drag handle pill\n- Mobile: slide-up animation, rounded top, 44px safe-area padding\n\nStats page — new productivity metrics:\n- Quick stats strip: done this week, in progress, due in 3 days, unassigned\n- 7-day completion bar chart (using done_at, today highlighted in indigo)\n- Priority breakdown: stacked bar + legend for urgent/high/normal open tasks\n- Enhanced member cards: show done·open counts, in-progress count, completion %\n- Both mobile (StatsScreen) and desktop (DesktopStats) updated\n\nGrocery UX redesign:\n- Square checkbox → circular tick button (faint grey check outline when unchecked, green filled when done)\n- Removed inline edit and delete buttons from GroceryRow\n- Entire row is clickable → opens GroceryDetailSheet\n- GroceryDetailSheet: live debounced updates (600ms batch), assignee immediate update\n- Delete with confirm inside detail sheet, no Save button needed\n- HistoryRow also clickable → opens same detail sheet (unmark / delete)\n- \"Saving…\" sync indicator while debounce fires\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fca878c055f1c44b28f8fd3adede1cf3134f9aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vibeoski/homejira/git/trees/2fca878c055f1c44b28f8fd3adede1cf3134f9aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vibeoski/homejira/git/commits/91123818bfc7b74b5aa69b176a5ac28189c1fe19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25981234?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vibeoski","id":25981234,"login":"vibeoski","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTgxMjM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vibeoski","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vibeoski/homejira/commit/91123818bfc7b74b5aa69b176a5ac28189c1fe19","node_id":"C_kwDORgRNldoAKDkxMTIzODE4YmZjN2I3NGI1YWE2OWIxNzZhNWFjMjgxODljMWZlMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vibeoski/homejira/commit/5fe4fd41cf16f40d8ba749ff09af3afe98fc93d7","sha":"5fe4fd41cf16f40d8ba749ff09af3afe98fc93d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vibeoski/homejira/commits/5fe4fd41cf16f40d8ba749ff09af3afe98fc93d7"}],"sha":"91123818bfc7b7